      "message": "```suggestion\n    print(f\"\u003e {shlex.join(cmd)}\")\n```\n\ntrying to join shell commands with spaces should never be done\n\nthe use of `\u003e` is weird since that\u0027s valid shell syntax, but i assume that makes sense in this particular context",
