      "writtenOn": "2023-08-31T18:57:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "the point of logging is to make it clear to humans what\u0027s happening.  showing an incorrectly quoted command will confuse people, and make it unnecessarily difficult for them to reproduce/debug.  using shlex.join literally costs nothing.\n\nnever join an argv command yourself with spaces.",
